<title>USA: U.S. Filter to buy United States Water.</title>
<headline>U.S. Filter to buy United States Water.</headline>
<dateline>PALM DESERT, Calif 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>United States Filter Corp said it signed a definitive agreement to buy United States Water Company, Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
